<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Betstack Pro · Syndicate</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0b0d10; --line:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  --text:#f6f7f9; --muted:#8c919b; --faint:#5a5f6a;
  --green:#1fd17a; --gold:#f4b740; --red:#f5495c;
  --d:'Sora',sans-serif; --b:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html,body{height:100%;}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--b);
  display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}

/* Every slide carries .bsp-clip — the app probes for it to know a clip exists. */
.bsp-clip{display:none;width:100%;height:100%;padding:24px 22px;position:relative;
  background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 15% 0%,rgba(31,209,122,.10),transparent 60%),
             radial-gradient(90% 70% at 100% 100%,rgba(244,183,64,.07),transparent 60%),var(--bg);
  flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;}
.bsp-clip.on{display:flex;}

.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.3;pointer-events:none;
  background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px,transparent 1px),
                   linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:34px 34px;animation:drift 24s linear infinite;}
@keyframes drift{to{background-position:34px 34px,34px 34px;}}

.brand{position:absolute;top:18px;left:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;
  font-family:var(--d);font-weight:800;font-size:.72rem;}
.brand .bars{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:2px;height:14px;}
.brand .bars i{display:block;width:3px;border-radius:1px;background:var(--green);
  animation:eq 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;}
.brand .bars i:nth-child(1){height:5px;background:var(--faint);animation-delay:0s;}
.brand .bars i:nth-child(2){height:8px;background:var(--muted);animation-delay:.15s;}
.brand .bars i:nth-child(3){height:11px;animation-delay:.3s;}
.brand .bars i:nth-child(4){height:14px;animation-delay:.45s;}
@keyframes eq{0%,100%{transform:scaleY(1);}50%{transform:scaleY(.55);}}
.brand span.p{color:var(--muted);}
.n{position:absolute;top:18px;right:22px;font-family:var(--d);font-weight:700;
  font-size:.66rem;color:var(--faint);}

/* staggered entrance — replays every time a slide is shown */
.on .ic,.on h2,.on p,.on ul,.on .viz,.on .pill,.on .tiers,.on .ladder,.on .bar{
  animation:rise .55s cubic-bezier(.16,.84,.44,1) both;}
.on h2{animation-delay:.10s;} .on p{animation-delay:.18s;}
.on .viz{animation-delay:.24s;} .on ul{animation-delay:.28s;}
.on .tiers,.on .ladder,.on .bar{animation-delay:.26s;} .on .pill{animation-delay:.42s;}
@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}

.ic{font-size:2.4rem;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;}
.on .ic{animation:rise .55s cubic-bezier(.16,.84,.44,1) both,float 3.5s ease-in-out .6s infinite;}
@keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-5px);}}

h2{font-family:var(--d);font-weight:800;font-size:1.45rem;line-height:1.14;
  letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:9px;}
h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--green);}
h2 em.g{color:var(--gold);} h2 em.r{color:var(--red);}
p{font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.58;color:var(--muted);max-width:34ch;}
p b{color:var(--text);font-weight:700;}
ul{list-style:none;margin-top:11px;}
li{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.5;
  color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px;opacity:0;}
.on li{animation:rise .45s cubic-bezier(.16,.84,.44,1) both;}
.on li:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.32s;} .on li:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.40s;}
.on li:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.48s;} .on li:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.56s;}
.on li:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.64s;}
li s{text-decoration:none;color:var(--green);flex-shrink:0;}
li.g s{color:var(--gold);} li.r s{color:var(--red);}
.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;align-self:flex-start;margin-top:14px;
  padding:7px 13px;border-radius:99px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;
  background:rgba(31,209,122,.12);border:1px solid rgba(31,209,122,.34);color:var(--green);}
.pill.gold{background:rgba(244,183,64,.12);border-color:rgba(244,183,64,.34);color:var(--gold);}
.pill.warn{background:rgba(245,73,92,.10);border-color:rgba(245,73,92,.32);color:var(--red);}

.viz{margin-top:14px;}
.tiers{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.tier{padding:7px 11px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid currentColor;
  font-family:var(--d);font-weight:800;font-size:.7rem;text-align:center;}
.t-b{color:#cd7f4e;} .t-s{color:#c7ccd6;} .t-g{color:var(--gold);} .t-v{color:var(--green);}
.on .tier{animation:pop .45s cubic-bezier(.2,1.3,.5,1) both;}
.on .tier:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.30s;} .on .tier:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.38s;}
.on .tier:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.46s;} .on .tier:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.54s;}
@keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.7);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}

.ladder{margin-top:12px;}
.rung{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:9px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:4px;font-size:.8rem;}
.rung b{margin-left:auto;color:var(--gold);font-family:var(--d);}
.rung.top{border-color:rgba(244,183,64,.4);background:rgba(244,183,64,.07);}
.on .rung{animation:slideIn .5s cubic-bezier(.16,.84,.44,1) both;}
.on .rung:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.50s;} .on .rung:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.42s;}
.on .rung:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.34s;}
@keyframes slideIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-16px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}

.bar{height:7px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);overflow:hidden;margin-top:10px;}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green),var(--gold));width:0;}
.on .bar i{animation:fill 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.3,1) .55s both;}
@keyframes fill{to{width:var(--w,72%);}}

.journey{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px;}
.rk{padding:5px 9px;border-radius:8px;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);}
.rk.now{background:rgba(31,209,122,.14);border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green);}
.rk.top{background:rgba(244,183,64,.14);border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold);}
.on .rk{animation:pop .4s cubic-bezier(.2,1.3,.5,1) both;}
.on .rk:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.30s;} .on .rk:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.36s;}
.on .rk:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.42s;} .on .rk:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.48s;}
.on .rk:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.54s;} .on .rk:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.60s;}
.on .rk:nth-child(7){animation-delay:.66s;} .on .rk:nth-child(8){animation-delay:.72s;}

.crowd{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.pn{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.78rem;
  background:rgba(31,209,122,.12);border:1px solid rgba(31,209,122,.3);opacity:0;}
.on .pn{animation:pop .4s cubic-bezier(.2,1.3,.5,1) both;
  animation-delay:calc(.28s + var(--i,0) * .05s);}
.pn.out{background:rgba(245,73,92,.10);border-color:rgba(245,73,92,.3);}
.on .pn.out{animation:pop .4s cubic-bezier(.2,1.3,.5,1) both,fade 2.6s ease-in-out 1s infinite;
  animation-delay:calc(.28s + var(--i,0) * .05s),1s;}
@keyframes fade{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:.3;}}

.flow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-top:13px;font-size:.74rem;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.node{padding:7px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
  border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:600;}
.node.g{border-color:rgba(31,209,122,.4);color:var(--green);}
.node.gold{border-color:rgba(244,183,64,.4);color:var(--gold);}
.node.bad{border-color:rgba(245,73,92,.4);color:var(--red);}
.arw{color:var(--faint);animation:nudge 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;}
@keyframes nudge{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0);}50%{transform:translateX(4px);}}

.live{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red);
  animation:pulse 1.3s infinite;margin-right:6px;}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}50%{opacity:.35;transform:scale(.8);}}

.vault{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.tk{padding:6px 9px;border-radius:8px;font-family:var(--d);font-size:.64rem;font-weight:700;
  border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);opacity:0;}
.tk.w{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(31,209,122,.35);}
.tk.l{color:var(--red);border-color:rgba(245,73,92,.32);}
.on .tk{animation:pop .4s cubic-bezier(.2,1.3,.5,1) both;
  animation-delay:calc(.30s + var(--i,0) * .08s);}

@media(max-width:420px){
  h2{font-size:1.22rem;} p{font-size:.82rem;} .ic{font-size:1.95rem;}
  li{font-size:.78rem;} .bsp-clip{padding:20px 18px;} .flow{font-size:.68rem;}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *{animation:none !important;}
  li,.rk,.pn,.tk,.tier,.rung{opacity:1 !important;}
  .bar i{width:var(--w,72%) !important;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_01_what_is"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">1 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">🤝</div>
<h2>What the <em>Syndicate</em> is</h2>
<p>A members' group that follows the <b>same verified picks</b>, together. We publish the selection, the code and the proof — you decide whether to place it.</p>
<div class="crowd viz">
  <span class="pn" style="--i:0">🦁</span><span class="pn" style="--i:1">🐯</span><span class="pn" style="--i:2">🦅</span>
  <span class="pn" style="--i:3">🐺</span><span class="pn" style="--i:4">🦊</span><span class="pn" style="--i:5">🐻</span>
  <span class="pn" style="--i:6">🐬</span><span class="pn" style="--i:7">🦈</span>
</div>
<span class="pill">One group, one pick, one direction</span></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_02_own_money"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">2 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">💰</div>
<h2>Your money <em>stays yours</em></h2>
<p>There is <b>no pooled fund</b> and no shared wallet. We never hold, move or bet your money.</p>
<div class="flow viz"><span class="node">Your wallet</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node g">Your bookmaker</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node g">Your winnings</span></div>
<ul><li><s>▸</s>You stake your own bets</li><li><s>▸</s>You keep <b>100%</b> of what you win</li><li><s>▸</s>We never take a cut</li></ul>
<span class="pill">Nothing to hold, nothing to lose</span></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_03_why_group"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">3 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">🧠</div>
<h2>Why play as a <em>group</em>?</h2>
<p>Alone, you carry every decision yourself — and most people lose to <b>impulse</b>, not to bad luck.</p>
<ul>
  <li><s>▸</s>One researched pick instead of ten guesses</li>
  <li><s>▸</s>A rule to follow when emotion says otherwise</li>
  <li><s>▸</s>Everyone sees the same result — nowhere to hide</li>
  <li><s>▸</s>Discipline is easier when others are watching</li>
</ul>
<span class="pill">Structure beats impulse</span></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_04_strength"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">4 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">📊</div>
<h2>What the group <em>does for you</em></h2>
<p>Hours of work land as one message on your phone.</p>
<div class="flow viz"><span class="node">Fixtures</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node">Odds check</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node">Model</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node g">Your pick</span></div>
<ul><li><s>▸</s>Prices compared across bookmakers</li><li><s>▸</s>Value measured, not guessed</li><li><s>▸</s>You get the outcome, not the homework</li></ul></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_05_tiers"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">5 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">🎯</div>
<h2>Bronze, Silver, <em class="g">Gold</em>, <em>VIP</em></h2>
<p>Your tier sets how much you get and <b>how fast</b> you get it.</p>
<div class="tiers"><div class="tier t-b">BRONZE<br>$15</div><div class="tier t-s">SILVER<br>$26</div><div class="tier t-g">GOLD<br>$49</div><div class="tier t-v">VIP<br>$98</div></div>
<p style="margin-top:11px;font-size:.8rem;">Start small. Climb whenever you're ready.</p></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_06_subscription"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">6 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">💳</div>
<h2>What you're <em>paying for</em></h2>
<p>Your subscription buys <b>access</b> — picks, codes, the feed and your tier's features.</p>
<ul><li><s>▸</s>Not a stake, not a deposit</li><li><s>▸</s>Never returned, never grows</li><li><s>▸</s>Never restricts your withdrawals</li></ul>
<span class="pill">A fee for a service — nothing more</span></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_07_why_donations"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">7 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">⭐</div>
<h2>Why <em class="g">donations</em> exist</h2>
<p>Running this costs money every month — odds feeds, data APIs, hosting, the tools that find the picks.</p>
<div class="flow viz"><span class="node gold">Donations</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node">Odds APIs</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node">Better picks</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node g">You</span></div>
<ul><li class="g"><s>▸</s>They fund the feeds the group runs on</li><li class="g"><s>▸</s>They set your rank and priority</li><li class="g"><s>▸</s>They are <b>never</b> a stake or a return</li></ul></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_08_donations_rank"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">8 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">🪜</div>
<h2>Donations &amp; the <em class="g">ladder</em></h2>
<p>Your weekly donation sets your place. Higher up, you get the feed <b>first</b>.</p>
<div class="ladder">
  <div class="rung top">👑 Captain of the Week <b>$400</b></div>
  <div class="rung">2 · Ada <b>$250</b></div>
  <div class="rung">3 · You <b>$120</b></div>
</div>
<span class="pill gold">Buys priority — never a return</span></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_09_why_suspensions"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">9 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">🚫</div>
<h2>Why members get <em class="r">suspended</em></h2>
<p>A syndicate only works if the people in it <b>actually follow it</b>. Passengers weaken the whole group.</p>
<div class="crowd viz">
  <span class="pn" style="--i:0">✓</span><span class="pn" style="--i:1">✓</span><span class="pn" style="--i:2">✓</span>
  <span class="pn out" style="--i:3">✕</span><span class="pn" style="--i:4">✓</span><span class="pn" style="--i:5">✓</span>
  <span class="pn out" style="--i:6">✕</span><span class="pn" style="--i:7">✓</span>
</div>
<ul>
  <li class="r"><s>▸</s>No slip submitted — you didn't play</li>
  <li class="r"><s>▸</s>Donation lapsed for the week</li>
  <li class="r"><s>▸</s>Slip code doesn't match the tip</li>
  <li class="r"><s>▸</s>One account shared between people</li>
</ul></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_10_reinstate"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">10 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">🔄</div>
<h2>Suspended? <em>Come back</em></h2>
<p>A suspension is a pause, not a punishment. Two steps and you're back on the feed.</p>
<div class="flow viz"><span class="node">Submit a slip</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node">Donate this week</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node g">Back on the feed</span></div>
<p style="margin-top:11px;font-size:.8rem;">Your badges, points and rank are <b>never</b> taken away.</p></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_11_compliance"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">11 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">📋</div>
<h2>Submitting <em>your slip</em></h2>
<p>Show us you actually played — that's the whole entry price to the feed.</p>
<ul><li><s>▸</s>Submit a booked slip each week</li><li><s>▸</s>The <b>booking code must match</b> the tip</li><li><s>▸</s>Keep your weekly donation active</li></ul>
<span class="pill">Played + donated = on the feed</span></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_12_notifications"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">12 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">🔔</div>
<h2>Push <em>notifications</em></h2>
<p>Picks reach you the moment they drop — if you're on the feed.</p>
<div class="flow viz"><span class="node g">VIP</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node gold">Gold</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node">Silver</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node">Bronze</span></div>
<ul><li><s>▸</s>Gold &amp; VIP get <b>automatic push</b></li><li><s>▸</s>Higher tiers are notified first</li></ul></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_13_live_sessions"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">13 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">🔴</div>
<h2><span class="live"></span>Live <em>sessions</em></h2>
<p>We announce a session so you know to be online. Then picks drop fast.</p>
<ul><li><s>▸</s>Declared ahead — be ready</li><li><s>▸</s>VIP enters the war-room first</li><li><s>▸</s>Missing one is normal, never chase</li></ul>
<span class="pill">Be online, be ready</span></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_14_odds_floor"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">14 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">📉</div>
<h2>The <em>odds floor</em></h2>
<p>Live prices move by the second. Every live pick carries a <b>minimum price</b>.</p>
<div class="flow viz"><span class="node g">Posted 1.95</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node gold">Floor 1.85</span><span class="arw">→</span><span class="node bad">1.70 — skip</span></div>
<p style="margin-top:11px;font-size:.8rem;">If you can't still get the floor, <b>don't place it</b>. A bad price turns a good pick into a bad bet.</p></section>

<section class="bsp-clip" id="syn_15_gold_vip"><div class="grid"></div>
<div class="brand"><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>BETSTACK <span class="p">PRO</span></div><div class="n">15 / 24</div>
<div class="ic">💎</div>
